description: >-
  React UI conventions for ecommerce-store (JSX) and the Chorus web console (TSX).
  Apply when editing UI components, pages, routing, or client state.
globs: "{ecommerce-store,web}/**/*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx,css}"
alwaysApply: false
